{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "A Quick Coffee Break"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "And Then My Mother  Called"}, {"type": "position", "content": 10}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 10}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe past experiences in a range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "packed"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "very crowded with people"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The restaurant was packed for weekend brunch."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le10ob10aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about health issues."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to jam up"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to form a crowd in a limited space"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Customers jammed up the front desk of the restaurant all morning. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le10ob10aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to perform"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to go through the steps of doing a medical procedure"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The doctors have performed some tests on my father."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le10ob10aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to be in the middle of "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "in the process of doing a task"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I was in the middle of keeping all the waiting customers under control, and then my mother called."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le10ob10aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "crowd"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a large gathering of people"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There was a large crowd waiting at the front of the restaurant."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le10ob10aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "consequence"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the result of an action"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He used to eat a lot of deep-fried food, so now he has heart trouble as a consequence."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le10ob10aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Present Perfect and Past Simple Tenses"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Present Perfect tense to talk about a finished action or event that is connected to the present in some way.<br><br>You use the Simple Past tense to talk about a finished action or event not connected to the present."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you use the Present Perfect, there is a connection between what happened in the past and now. You can use time markers like <span class=\"italic\"> for, just</span> or <span class=\"italic\"> ever</span> with the Present Perfect.<br><br>When you use the Simple Past tense, the time is always in the past. You can use time markers, like <span class=\"italic\">then, ago, yesterday, when I was</span>\u2026  <br><br>Look at the chart about how to form the Present Perfect tense:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Tense Form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Perfect Form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to be\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was / were\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"has/have been\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Your restaurant has always been popular.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to perform\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"performed\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"has/have performed\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The doctors have performed some tests.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to see\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"saw\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"has/have seen\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I haven't seen her for a long time.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to catch\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"caught\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"has/have caught\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The consequences have caught up with him.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Customers jammed up the front desk all morning."}, {"type": "example", "content": "My mother called when I was in the middle of my work."}, {"type": "example", "content": "My father ate a lot of deep-fried food."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Used to</span> and <span class=\"italic\">Would</span> for Past Habits"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Would</span> and <span class=\"italic\">used to</span> have similar meanings. They are both used to describe something that happened regularly in the past but doesn't happen any longer.<br><br>However, there is an important difference between <span class=\"italic\">used to</span> and <span class=\"italic\">would</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Would</span> is not used unless you know that the time frame is in the past, while <span class=\"italic\">used to</span> does not require this."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Both <span class=\"italic\">used to</span> and <span class=\"italic\">would</span> are followed with a verb in the base form."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Subject + <span class=\"italic\">used to</span> + verb<br><span class=\"italic\">My father used to take me to the park.</span<"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Subject + <span class=\"italic\">would</span> + verb<br><span class=\"italic\">My grandfather and I would go to the library once a week, and he would help me pick out a book.</span>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Used to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Would\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Customers used to come early in the morning.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">They would line up outside even in the cold.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">My parents and I used to have regular visits.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">They would come in to town once a week.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">My father used to eat a lot of dishes high in fat.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">He would eat that for dinner almost every day.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6